  "type": "Click",
  "display_name": "Scorpion's Sting",
  "display_fullname": "Guardian Assault Ninja Assault Scorpions Sting",
  "display_help": "You take aim and strike a target with a throwing knife coated in a larger amount of debilitating poison. This attack inflicts minor Lethal damage on impact before inflicting moderate Toxic damage over time. The poison additionally will weaken the target, Slowing their movement and reducing the amount of damage they deal, and may even briefly Hold the target paralyzed and helpless. Damage: High, Recharge: Slow",
